@gateway = https://localhost:7000
@chatInternal = https://localhost:7800
@schoolId = 11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111
@sessionId = 22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222
@previewId = 33333333-3333-4333-8333-333333333333
@operationId = 44444444-4444-4444-8444-444444444444
# Supply tokens and IDs from a configured synthetic environment.
@userToken = REPLACE_WITH_USER_TOKEN
@workloadToken = REPLACE_WITH_SCOPED_WORKLOAD_TOKEN
@fingerprint = REPLACE_WITH_EXACT_PREVIEW_DIGEST

### Create private school-scoped session; retain this key for retries
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/chat/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{operationId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"schoolId":"{{schoolId}}"}

### Generate synchronous reply (model disabled by default)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/chat/sessions/{{sessionId}}/messages?schoolId={{schoolId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Idempotency-Key: 55555555-5555-4555-8555-555555555555
Content-Type: application/json

{"text":"Show my enrollments in the current synthetic school."}

### Review exact server preview before approval
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/chat/action-previews/{{previewId}}?schoolId={{schoolId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Human consent only; operationId/key/digest must come from that preview
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/chat/action-previews/{{previewId}}/confirmations?schoolId={{schoolId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Origin: https://localhost:4200
Idempotency-Key: {{operationId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"operationId":"{{operationId}}","argumentsFingerprint":"{{fingerprint}}","approved":true}

### Internal recorded-intent query; executionAllowed always false
POST {{chatInternal}}/internal/v1/chat/confirmations/validate
Authorization: Bearer {{workloadToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"schoolId":"{{schoolId}}","sessionId":"{{sessionId}}","previewId":"{{previewId}}","identityId":"66666666-6666-4666-8666-666666666666","operationId":"{{operationId}}","argumentsFingerprint":"{{fingerprint}}"}
